"`~wave.Wave_read` and :class:`~wave.Wave_write` classes have been deprecated "
"since Python 3.13."
msgstr ""
":class:`~wave.Wave_read` クラスと :class:`~wave.Wave_write` クラスの "
"``getmark()``、``setmark()``、``getmarkers()`` メソッドは Python 3.13 から非"
"推奨です。"

msgid ":mod:`zipimport`:"
msgstr ":mod:`zipimport`:"

